# Per-user multi-key credential store (accounts.py / AccountStore).
# It MAY hold literal API keys (env-mode key bundles) -> NEVER commit it.
# The committed accounts.example.json shows the shape with ${ENV} references.
# The hub also WRITES this file when it seeds numbered backup keys
# (EXA_API_KEY_2 ...), but only ever as ${ENV} references, never literals.
accounts.json
accounts.json.tmp

# Python caches
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
